==Battleground==
*1 [[Angel Fanboy]] spawns.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] (100%) spawns.
*Infinite [[Ms. Sign]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 1~1.67 seconds<sup>30f~50f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Sunfish Jones|Sunfish Joneses]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Angelic Sleipnir]]s spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] (1,000%) spawn, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since the stage has a maximum number of 10 enemies, the Ms. Sign flood will fill up the limit rather easily and prevent the endless waves of overbuffed Angels from spawning. Stalling the Angelic Gory with low damage meatshields like [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] for about a minute should be easy, as he has a very low strength magnification. When the Ms. Signs appear, kill the Angelic Gory, then use a fast attacking unit to knock them behind the base and claim victory.

Avoid using units with piercing abilities such as [[Wave Attack|Wave]] and [[Long Distance]], specially those with damage boosting abilities, as they may cause the Ms. Signs to die even behind the enemy base, leading to the wave of Angels spawning anyway.

